    "sections": {
        "description": "ST Laundry Services is a modern, responsive, and easy to use WordPress theme built for laundry, dry cleaning, laundromat, cleaning business, cleaning service, ironing, laundry press, wash and fold, clothing repair, tailor, cleaning company, and garment care businesses. The theme offers a polished and professional layout that presents your services, pricing plans, working hours, and booking or contact details in a clear and well structured way. It is lightweight, SEO friendly, translation ready, and works smoothly with popular WordPress plugins, so you can shape every section without writing a single line of code. Flexible customizer options let you adjust colors, typography, layouts, and section visibility in real time, while the fully mobile friendly design keeps your site fast and readable on phones, tablets, and desktops. Accessibility minded markup, clean code, and cross browser support make ST Laundry Services a dependable choice for laundromats, dry cleaners, ironing services, pickup and delivery laundry brands, and cleaning companies that want a simple, reliable, and professional online presence."
    },
